rd of blindness  before but sympathizes eventually things  settle into a familiar rhythm professor  zorkanov continues to operate his  gallery for the pleasure of all of his  visitors and the foundation need only  station one armed guard in the apartment  instead of spending time money and  effort forcing everyone into  inconvenient containment in the middle  of a crowded city but just a few short  months later the foundation receives a  call from the agent on duty requesting  backup once again the mtf arrived on  scene kitted out for cognito hazards  they enter into  scp-4149 heavily armed and armored this  time they find something much more  surprising and dangerous than an art  exhibition the guests are lurking around  the edges of the walls but the professor  is in the middle of the floor arguing  extremely slowly with two more giant  sloths they're dressed in tactical  combat gear and holding what looked to  be guns their yelling sped up is made  clear the newcomers are berating the  professor for expressing his art and for  running from something called the  xenarthra council when they finally  notice the presence of the mtf they  scoff and gradually raise their weapons  telling the mtf to leave while they  still have the chance but while one of  them is busy yelling at the sloths to  drop their weapons another one of the  troops simply walks over and pulls the  guns out of the clawed paws of the  sloths come on they're sloths man by the  time they slowly realize their weapons  are no longer in their hands the sloths  panic at the thought of these strange  furless creatures moving so many times  faster than they ever thought possible  just before they're handcuffed the pair  disappear in a burst of green light and  at this all the guests burst into  applause this conflict this emotion this  humor  this is the performance they were  waiting for the whole time now check out  killer living graffiti  scp-1155 predatory street art or scp-683  refrigerator art for more art-related  anomalies that will blow your mind

